{"abstract":[{"text":"This parameter defines the range for the fade-out effect before an automatic content cutoff on pitched map views. Fade out is implemented by scaling down and removing buildings in the fade range in a staggered fashion. Opacity is not changed. The fade range is expressed in relation to the height of the map view. A value of 1.0 indicates that the content is faded to the same extent as the map’s height in pixels, while a value close to zero represents a sharp cutoff. When the value is set to 0.0, the cutoff is completely disabled. Note: The property has no effect on the map if terrain is enabled.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"Default value: 0. Value range: [0, 1]"}],"sections":[],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"identifier","text":"fillExtrusionCutoffFadeRange"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"text":"_","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"constant","kind":"internalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Double","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sd"},{"kind":"text","text":") -> "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.mapbox.MapboxMaps\/documentation\/MapboxMaps\/FillExtrusionLayer","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:10MapboxMaps18FillExtrusionLayerV","text":"FillExtrusionLayer"}],"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["iOS"]}]}],"kind":"symbol","identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/com.mapbox.MapboxMaps\/documentation\/MapboxMaps\/FillExtrusionLayer\/fillExtrusionCutoffFadeRange(_:)-2kfwa"},"metadata":{"fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"fillExtrusionCutoffFadeRange","kind":"identifier"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Double","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sd"},{"text":") -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"FillExtrusionLayer","preciseIdentifier":"s:10MapboxMaps18FillExtrusionLayerV","kin